BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downtown Elmira's Small Business Saturday Local Shop Giveaway!
DTSTART:20261128T160000Z
DTEND:20261128T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261128T172939Z
UID:7cab903cb5b402c1c8fb3969cb6b19b09e82025b@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Community
DESCRIPTION:Event by Elmira Downtown Development\, Inc\n231 W. Water St. s
 uite 102\, Elmira\, NY\nPublic\nSmall Business Saturday is almost here\, a
 nd we’re kicking it off with something brand new downtown!\nOn Saturday
 \, November 28\, come discover your Elmira this holiday season. The first 
 250 people to stop by the Elmira Downtown Development office at 231 W Wate
 r Street\, Suite 102\, from 11am to 1pm will receive a free Elmira Downtow
 n Holiday Shopping Bag in red and black houndstooth\, packed with mystery 
 prizes\, deals from local businesses\, and a chance to win gift cards to y
 our favorite local spots.\nWant a shot at a $100 gift card to spend locall
 y? Enter the sweepstakes for free at https://www.zeffy.com/.../small-busin
 ess-saturday-elmira.... Entries open October 19 and close at 11:59 PM on N
 ovember 23\, with the winner drawn November 24. Entering does not reserve 
 a shopping bag\, so you’ll need to come downtown on November 28 to pick 
 one up.\nThis event is made possible by our presenting sponsor\, Hilliard
 \, along with Chemung Supply Corporation\, Pudgie’s Pizza and Subs\, Sie
 mens Energy\, and Patrick’s. Thank you for supporting downtown Elmira!\n
 Shop local\, support your neighbors\, and let’s make this holiday season
  a good one downtown.\nelmiradowntown.com\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:/
 /calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514613/20261128110000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514613/20261128110000
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Opening Day: World's Largest Traveling Harmonica Museum at Marich 
 Music\, Corning
DTSTART:20261128T170000Z
DTEND:20261128T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261128T172939Z
UID:2618991b7d402fda071d07eeb13b42c902277688@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Family Fun,Holidays,New to the Area
DESCRIPTION:DATES: Opens Saturday\, November 28\, 2026 and runs through Th
 ursday\, December 31\, 2026\nHOURS: Mon-Sat 12-6 p.m.\, Sun 12-4 p.m.\; De
 c 24 and Dec 31 12-4 p.m.\; closed Dec 25 and Sun. Dec 27\nLOCATION: Maric
 h Music\, 62 E. Market St.\, Corning\, NY 14830 (2nd-floor gallery\, stair
 s only)\nCOST: Suggested $2 cash donation to benefit the Food Bank of the 
 Southern Tier\nDESCRIPTION:\nThe World's Largest Traveling Harmonica Museu
 m is at Marich Music for the holidays! Ken VanEtten\, retired Corning scho
 ol music teacher\, fills the upstairs gallery with more than 1\,500 harmon
 icas in over 50 displays: the World's Largest Harmonica (donated by the Fa
 bulous Sgro Brothers)\, the world's loudest harmonica\, harmonicas shaped 
 like cars\, blimps\, airplanes\, vegetables and animals\, harmonicas with 
 trumpets\, horns and bells\, the rare Elmira harmonica (National Harmonica
  Company\, 1919 to the early 1920s)\, and the 20th century told through ha
 rmonica boxes\, from early flight and two world wars to the golden age of 
 radio. Admission is a suggested $2 cash donation to the Food Bank of the S
 outhern Tier. The gallery is on the second floor and is accessible by stai
 rs only.\nClick here for full details\nClick here to learn more about Mari
 ch Music\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/
 78515463/20261128120000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78515463/20261128120000
END:VEVENT
