DESCRIPTION:Event by The Empty Hourglass\, Embers & Ashes/ Fae Realm Nails
  and Chelle Renee\nFollow map I posted.\nElmira Heights\, NY\nPublic\nA co
 zy ladies' night of beaded Christmas crafts\, coffee\, cocoa\, music\, lau
 ghter\, and optional gel manicures.Come make a little holiday magic\nLadie
 s\, it's time to put the holiday hustle aside\, grab your favorite gals\, 
 and enjoy an evening of creativity\, coffee\, cocoa\, and Christmas cheer!
 \nJoin us for a fun and festive Ladies' Craft Night\, where we'll be makin
 g beautiful handmade beaded tinsel to add a little extra sparkle and perso
 nality to your Christmas tree!\nNo crafting experience necessary — just 
 bring yourself\, your creativity\, and a willingness to have some fun!\nWh
 at's in store?\n- A cozy coffee & hot cocoa bar\n- All the supplies to cre
 ate your own beaded Christmas tinsel\n- Festive music and holiday vibes\n-
  Good conversation\, lots of laughter\, and a chance to meet some lovely l
 adies\n- A relaxed evening of crafting\, connecting\, and making memories
 \nWant a little extra sparkle?\nThere will also be an optional opportunity
  to treat yourself to a single-color gel manicure during the evening! A li
 ttle pampering to go along with your girls' night out. Manicures are compl
 etely optional and available for an additional cost. ($30)\nWhether you're
  coming with your best friend\, your sister\, your daughter\, or flying so
 lo and looking to make some new friends\, there's a seat waiting for you!
 \nCome as you are\, sip something delicious\, make something pretty\, and 
 enjoy an evening that's all about YOU.\nBecause Christmas magic is even be
 tter when it's made together.\nGrab your girls and come make a little holi
 day magic with us!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0u
 zpj/event/78519365/20261202170000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78519365/20261202170000
