DESCRIPTION:Event by 360Aurora\n360 E. 14th St\nElmira Heights\, NY\nPubli
 c\nFriday\, December 11th at 7PM\nOne night. Nonstop laughs. Join Zahan Si
 gara & Jo Rou for an unforgettable live stand-up comedy show in Elmira Hei
 ghts\, NY.\nOne Night. Nonstop Laughs.\nGet ready for an unforgettable nig
 ht of live stand-up comedy featuring Zahan Sigara at Aurora 360 in the hea
 rt of Elmira Heights\, NY.\nWhether you're planning a date night\, a night
  out with friends\, or just need a good laugh\, this is the comedy show yo
 u've been waiting for.\nOne of Canada's fastest-rising touring comedians\,
  Zahan Sigara has performed across Canada and the United States\, sharing 
 stages with comedians including Luis J. Gomez\, Caitlin Peluffo\, Sean Col
 lins\, Ed Bassmaster\, Corey B\, and more.\nKnown for his quick crowd work
 \, razor-sharp observations\, and stories about divorce\, dating\, and eve
