  and the Elmira Aviators NAHL for Christmas at the Hangar!\nSaturday\, Dec
 ember 19\nGame time: 7:00 PM\nLECOM Event Center\nFRPCV will be there with
  our Traveling Bright Red Bookshelf\, giving kids the chance to pick out f
 ree books to take home and read over winter break. The books are theirs to
  keep!\nWe’ll also be collecting new and gently used children’s books 
 for children from birth through age 12. If your family has books your chil
 dren have outgrown\, bring them to the game and we’ll help get them into
  the hands of another local child.\nCome enjoy a night of hockey and Chris
 tmas at the Hangar\, donate a book\, and make sure the kids have something
  new to read over winter break!\nElmira Aviators vs. New Hampshire Mountai
